    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centered around the small desert town of Tide Line, the game\u2019s story unfolds as you embark on a journey to unravel the mysteries left behind by a team that vanished during a mysterious event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/d51248da33ad49cb488553e8b1f92854.poster.avif?t=1731572849\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/d51248da33ad49cb488553e8b1f92854.webm?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/d51248da33ad49cb488553e8b1f92854.mp4?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take up your lantern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/0a21eebf12041c5ef13b072f87288710.poster.avif?t=1731572849\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/0a21eebf12041c5ef13b072f87288710.webm?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/0a21eebf12041c5ef13b072f87288710.mp4?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the most important tool of the exploration team, your lantern is not only a weapon to defend against threats but also serves multiple other functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to defeating enemies, it interacts with various elements in the world around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore unique environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/5171eb6adb2e03fef318aa6a8c0b6848.poster.avif?t=1731572849\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/5171eb6adb2e03fef318aa6a8c0b6848.webm?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/5171eb6adb2e03fef318aa6a8c0b6848.mp4?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tide Line town and its surrounding areas are vast and varied, each area hiding secrets waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/400161c503cd356fd85c8edd63a13975.poster.avif?t=1731572849\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/400161c503cd356fd85c8edd63a13975.webm?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/400161c503cd356fd85c8edd63a13975.mp4?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the strange \u201ccarriage,\u201d you will travel through time and space within Tide Line town, gradually uncovering hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the mysteries unfold, new truths and possibilities about the events will be revealed before you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centered around the small desert town of Tide Line, the game\u2019s story unfolds as you embark on a journey to unravel the mysteries left behind by a team that vanished during a mysterious event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/d51248da33ad49cb488553e8b1f92854.poster.avif?t=1731572849\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/d51248da33ad49cb488553e8b1f92854.webm?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/d51248da33ad49cb488553e8b1f92854.mp4?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take up your lantern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/0a21eebf12041c5ef13b072f87288710.poster.avif?t=1731572849\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/0a21eebf12041c5ef13b072f87288710.webm?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/0a21eebf12041c5ef13b072f87288710.mp4?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the most important tool of the exploration team, your lantern is not only a weapon to defend against threats but also serves multiple other functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to defeating enemies, it interacts with various elements in the world around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore unique environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/5171eb6adb2e03fef318aa6a8c0b6848.poster.avif?t=1731572849\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/5171eb6adb2e03fef318aa6a8c0b6848.webm?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/5171eb6adb2e03fef318aa6a8c0b6848.mp4?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tide Line town and its surrounding areas are vast and varied, each area hiding secrets waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/400161c503cd356fd85c8edd63a13975.poster.avif?t=1731572849\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/400161c503cd356fd85c8edd63a13975.webm?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319620/extras/400161c503cd356fd85c8edd63a13975.mp4?t=1731572849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the strange \u201ccarriage,\u201d you will travel through time and space within Tide Line town, gradually uncovering hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the mysteries unfold, new truths and possibilities about the events will be revealed before you.</p>",
    "short_description": "Tide Line is a pixel/lo-fi style top-down ARPG that focuses on exploration, puzzle-solving, and combat, all while immersing you in its world.You wake up in an unfamiliar waterway, with no sign of the exploration team that was with you. What happened here?",
